From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:13:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] platform/surface: platform_profile: Handle the Surface Laptop
 8 15-inch's EC

2390 remembers the written profile on the Surface Laptop 8, whose EC
reports profile 0 whatever was written. The 15-inch model runs the same
Surface firmware and EC as the 13.8-inch model, so apply the workaround
to it too.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 drivers/platform/surface/surface_platform_profile.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/platform/surface/surface_platform_profile.c b/drivers/platform/surface/surface_platform_profile.c
index b534c58..c2b01f0 100644
--- a/drivers/platform/surface/surface_platform_profile.c
+++ b/drivers/platform/surface/surface_platform_profile.c
@@ -246,7 +246,8 @@ static int surface_platform_profile_probe(struct ssam_device *sdev)
 	ssam_device_set_drvdata(sdev, tpd);
 
 	tpd->has_fan = device_property_read_bool(&sdev->dev, "has_fan");
-	tpd->ec_reports_zero = of_machine_is_compatible("microsoft,surface-laptop-8-13p8");
+	tpd->ec_reports_zero = of_machine_is_compatible("microsoft,surface-laptop-8-13p8") ||
+			       of_machine_is_compatible("microsoft,surface-laptop-8-15");
 
 	/*
 	 * If the EC does not report its profile, start from a known one:
-- 
2.47.3

